# 7. Database Constraints and Integrity

Implement the following integrity rules:

1. Business Challenge names must not be empty.
2. Business Challenge slugs must be unique.
3. Only active Business Challenges can be newly associated with an Insight article.
4. An article cannot have duplicate associations with the same Business Challenge.
5. An article cannot have more than one primary Business Challenge.
6. Only Insight content can be associated with Business Challenges.
7. Existing relationships must be preserved when a challenge is deactivated.
8. Deleting an article should remove its relationship records automatically through the appropriate foreign-key behavior.
9. Deleting a Business Challenge with existing associations should be prevented.
10. Invalid or nonexistent challenge IDs must be rejected.

Do not rely exclusively on frontend validation. Implement important integrity rules at the database level wherever practical.

